9,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Rango, a lost family pet, accidentally winds up in the gritty, gun-slinging Western town of Dirt, the theater-loving lizard suddenly finds himself the newly appointed sheriff. Welcomed as the last hope the town has been waiting for, Rango is forced to play his new role to the hilt and uncover the truth behind a looming water crisis—before his act catches up with him.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":333484,\"title\":\"The Magnificent Seven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ezcS78TIjgr85pVdaPDd2rSPVNs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4qxZJRYe4ezA5J1sidnV7vuaYaz.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Looking to mine for gold, greedy industrialist Bartholomew Bogue seizes control of the Old West town of Rose Creek. With their lives in jeopardy, Emma Cullen and other desperate residents turn to bounty hunter Sam Chisolm for help. Chisolm recruits an eclectic group of gunslingers to take on Bogue and his ruthless henchmen. With a deadly showdown on the horizon, the seven mercenaries soon find themselves fighting for more than just money once the bullets start to fly.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":44264,\"title\":\"True Grit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tCrB8pcjadZjsDk7rleGJaIv78k.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5dwlH8Krm2bsuc2Pubw2cBb03g5.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following the murder of her father by a hired hand, a 14-year-old farm girl sets out to capture the killer. To aid her, she hires the toughest U.S. Marshal she can find—a man with 'true grit'—Reuben J. 'Rooster' Cogburn.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":57201,\"title\":\"The Lone Ranger\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yDuJGq8biNMW7zM3w95UaDJv0KG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHd8RTXTGFwexUC2Mj1HOgSy9J3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The Texas Rangers chase down a gang of outlaws led by Butch Cavendish, but the gang ambushes the Rangers, seemingly killing them all. One survivor is found, however, by an American Indian named Tonto, who nurses him back to health. The Ranger, donning a mask and riding a white stallion named Silver, teams up with Tonto to bring the unscrupulous gang and others of that ilk to justice.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1656,\"title\":\"The Legend of Zorro\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/93iEBX1QbsxAv8eSybe8lhLXY1A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2b3PSB97qrxQduzquYihf7u3uwV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Despite trying to keep his swashbuckling to a minimum, a threat to California's pending statehood causes the adventure-loving Don Alejandro de la Vega and his wife, Elena, to take action.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8584,\"title\":\"Shanghai Noon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b0WwWRcDiDahkah5vZ0KjB4N9ZZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuwPmDMHslcx71T7zHc9YqF2Ny3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Chon Wang, a clumsy imperial guard, trails Princess Pei Pei when she's kidnapped from the Forbidden City and transported to America. Wang follows her captors to Nevada, where he teams up with an unlikely partner, outcast outlaw Roy O'Bannon, and tries to spring the princess from her imprisonment.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":384680,\"title\":\"Hostiles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rqoezyB51GfhiloOB5ZErg5HXas.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vBSsIyWExRpe3Robi8SAnayrMq1.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A legendary Native American-hating Army captain nearing retirement in 1892 is given one last assignment: to escort a Cheyenne chief and his family through dangerous territory back to his Montana reservation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6038,\"title\":\"Shanghai Knights\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vVNQStMlZS9mn2AKBEpadRunHgt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoXqOWzD0HGZttYi0wHMvvGJZhZ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a Chinese rebel murders Chon's estranged father and escapes to England, Chon and Roy make their way to London with revenge on their minds.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":347969,\"title\":\"The Ridiculous 6\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kPc80jywR5Nm2KIQjkY5i4VXSx4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cB9XLza46oXuBtfuEUktThmQf6F.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When his long-lost outlaw father returns, Tommy \\\"White Knife\\\" Stockburn goes on an adventure-filled journey across the Old West with his five brothers.\",\"genres\":[\"Western\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":481848,\"title\":\"The Call of the Wild\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/33VdppGbeNxICrFUtW2WpGHvfYc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GZCV0dwIoAn6jpWPfVAbeMTVC2.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Buck is a big-hearted dog whose blissful domestic life is turned upside down when he is suddenly uprooted from his California home and transplanted to the exotic wilds of the Yukon during the Gold Rush of the 1890s. As the newest rookie on a mail delivery dog sled team—and later its leader—Buck experiences the adventure of a lifetime, ultimately finding his true place in the world and becoming his own master.\",